0..75 Comment "// A scope\'s clause receives the rest of the scope as a continuation it may"
76..154 Comment "// drop or resume twice. An operation the scope answers while the parent holds"
155..231 Comment "// its task\'s end hands that end to the clause, which could leave it open or"
232..278 Comment "// read it twice, so the operation is refused."
280..303 Comment "// The task\'s protocol."
